12. DESIGN LANGUAGE

Every vehicle should share:

✔ Sharp military lines

✔ Angular armor

✔ Modular panels

✔ Exposed bolts

✔ Cooling vents

✔ Sensor clusters

✔ Maintenance hatches

✔ Identification markings

✔ Small warning decals

✔ Consistent antenna style

✔ Same headlight family

✔ Same camera family

✔ Same weapon mounts

The goal is for someone to immediately recognize "This belongs to The Warden Program."

