16. MODELING RULES

Every asset must:

Be modeled at real-world scale.
Have the pivot correctly placed before export.
Use meaningful object names (Body, Wheel_FL, Rotor_01, etc.) instead of default names like pCube1.
Freeze transforms.
Delete construction history.
Keep the forward direction consistent for Unity.
Export at Scale Factor = 1.
17. FUTURE FACTIONS

Leave room in the design language so future factions feel distinct:

The Warden Program: Angular, modular, utilitarian.
Enemy AI Faction: Aggressive, asymmetrical, exposed mechanics.
Corporate Faction: Clean, polished, premium materials.
Experimental/Black Ops: Stealth, faceted surfaces, minimal visible hardware.

This lets players identify a faction instantly by silhouette, even before they notice colors or markings.
